    "detailed_description": "<h1>Add my new game to your wish list!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Dungeon Knight is a platform jump game in which players need to use their jumping ability to avoid enemies and traps. At the same time, you need to use some props to help you complete the challenge. </strong><br><br><i>Dungeon Full of Traps</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340290/extras/51d5e0820aef6f400d94ec7cd350cc9a.poster.avif?t=1706659006\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340290/extras/51d5e0820aef6f400d94ec7cd350cc9a.webm?t=1706659006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340290/extras/51d5e0820aef6f400d94ec7cd350cc9a.mp4?t=1706659006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>Reverse Gravity, Complete the Challenge</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340290/extras/f8c72e24f262d28a111b80f785aea4f1.poster.avif?t=1706659006\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340290/extras/f8c72e24f262d28a111b80f785aea4f1.webm?t=1706659006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340290/extras/f8c72e24f262d28a111b80f785aea4f1.mp4?t=1706659006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>Calculate Jump Timing and Distance, Dodge Danger</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340290/extras/fb86e33ddc8585bb594f9c297a27133c.poster.avif?t=1706659006\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340290/extras/fb86e33ddc8585bb594f9c297a27133c.webm?t=1706659006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340290/extras/fb86e33ddc8585bb594f9c297a27133c.mp4?t=1706659006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><br>\u00b7 Simple operation, fun adventure.<br><br>\u00b7 Exquisite level design, each level is hand-drawn.<br><br>\u00b7 Support all popular game handles, without any settings, just connect the handles.<br><br>\u00b7 Exquisite game screen, players will cross to various styles of dungeons in the game.<br><br>\u00b7 Good game soundtrack.",
